          <problem id="prob-00002">
            <para id="para-00006">Use the graphing tool here or technology outside the course. Then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00002">
            <para id="para-00007">Compare your answer:</para>
